ps://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619836_1237132168326387_2183731442049155847_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5QoAjVNMNOcQ7kNvwGCznif&_nc_oc=Ado8GO7tyvSg2RqSIX_292ikqyjOBKSoBGi6dCgSCL9ajy17HMF9LYxst51pOEUH-C0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_E_MjldYj_OcBsumISfepfDb9hAGrB78miBWCYzoCB0w&oe=6A329A0F"}, {"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ENG.png", "id": "884644501207363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823893_884644504540696_1379382285860789409_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1FkgbTbLz7IQ7kNvwE-hIFs&_nc_oc=AdooQ3LqYfbMOdp-NS4L7zrUFEMq-4X04yyqyRStzvP7c0zrVkGTz1LanqI4NeH2rbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_JItKp0ezCmFHt-wCi5XBYiylJ_DdmRfn0FBxjl-V8GQ&oe=6A32BEFE"}]}, "id": "2481659452294539", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-001.png", "id": "1204174037792977", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400248_1204174041126310_5851841347649338254_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-EeLqE3pkqkQ7kNvwHp1Cny&_nc_oc=AdqMaPEQmJZ1Ct-mPXuljiWc8ckpl-uo6D9-YBtZxhI_hAZujvB77lSY1vguyurOoy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-sJEu6rHGpNSs5L7811sSmRxf0I0UV2dkCXGUeVASjRQ&oe=6A32A0E1"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-002.png", "id": "1683364999261437", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1683365002594770_6182534077774161018_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O-AWVNSRIlgQ7kNvwEgsN4f&_nc_oc=AdotmalR5uY4YhcsmR50cnAHG-ehOC9nVlu1Z5tCUiUmr3hrLDKV7GIbrCnvQTSfMXY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8cvturZYaOg9XTmxwqDxQF6x9UomUhmxk_9IEs4z6P8g&oe=6A32A33F"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-004.png", "id": "645259521197957", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391893_645259524531290_1221040782683536363_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YghtlGE5NKUQ7kNvwFbL3dt&_nc_oc=Ado-6j-30gQsaYggKZKNSzrhGPvtp95DnfltaZ2k1TTkPA4IZdsQPIIB_w1DHobpWY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8eWGc-U9F1ZvFnvnA0Xl5Do4Ybf0fHD90ZpxfOCgesOA&oe=6A32BDCE"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-003.png", "id": "663923902976794", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393984_663923906310127_5574735863383485136_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A90-JhoUaiwQ7kNvwH95Ju4&_nc_oc=AdphdXOL5Zr_8jKRGI3ZhRYc22_ZIrMhsd8fF8FK4-FXasZdqz0LTXqZPENIy-SQ2ZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-GDu4AGU6SL8f9yROhsMTbcjfHJ9iXQ0XipUex17Kg6g&oe=6A32C659"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-005.png", "id": "590596830460245", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391890_590596833793578_6307124770371399137_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1YiN3mCOiFUQ7kNvwG8Z-wt&_nc_oc=AdqHjNtoUmynOe3KuiCNlk4Zq4W23XSd23MaiIB0DitI1G3p45OwA389w-3Lzwf7fvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Xlk7vSltJKhsAisCjtYxOQYgxvt81ZnJxf9r0HKcWDw&oe=6A32A84B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Echocardiography VR - VML", "keywords": ["Echography", "POCUS", "Medical", "Ultrasound", "Healthcare"], "long_description": "**Echocardiography VR**, by VML, is a virtual reality simulation that transforms how medical students and healthcare professionals learn cardiac ultrasound.\n\nStep into a simulation room where you'll master transducer positioning, orientation, and anatomical recognition through hands-on practice. Place the probe on your virtual patient, adjust it to find the correct windows, and activate **X-ray mode** to see how your transducer intersects the heart in real-time.\n\nThe machine offers three learning modes:\n- **2D Mode**: real echocardiography footage as you scan\n- **Freeze Mode**: anatomical illustrations where you identify each structure\n- **3D Mode**: slice through an interactive heart with a special probe and switch to ultrasound-style materials\n\n**Egbot**, your android guide, walks you through a complete tutorial to get the most out of each mode.\n\nWhether you're a student or healthcare professional, this simulation gives you a safe environment to build confidence before scanning real patients!", "short_description": "Improve your echocardiography skills with this immersive VR simulation! Step into the operating room to scan your virtual patient. Learn to identify different cardiac structures through interactive visualizations: see through the chest as if using X-rays, dissect a 3D heart to understand each structure, and more. All guided by Egbot, your virtual tutor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ES.png", "id": "2558894087837590", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822968_2558894094504256_5404181423913633795_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mj4MxCHAC7wQ7kNvwHaJVDC&_nc_oc=AdquqX28Mb_mUXr7mAbsUpysAaBek0p72HUHu0uoWPT9uvfGYojw4urrfl22PhDIBEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9pF_e57lVAz8RPoWquJhYEGJ8kq2Shdh5D1ZeGCHV5Aw&oe=6A32A3EE"}, {"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ES.png", "id": "1971181917156082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830888_1971181920489415_1647681755962022117_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ConMZkaYnHAQ7kNvwFjAfCU&_nc_oc=AdpbgKrpFmzxOd3F3NTG251tqbCrYgAbbE6w8wS8LBq6eT4Yps3n-SI03JZ0Wn6dUTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ljpC0Ksg8zynHgoBvS8yZMtR5pXo_orIfGtkdVW9mGw&oe=6A329A69"}, {"file_name": "Cover Square_FULL_ES-1.png", "id": "1912394656053179", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823893_1912394659386512_7066665920184004452_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8riPljxt_3oQ7kNvwH7wM09&_nc_oc=Adpo9CYjDTfXp_ZIXbCDVDDNHjquxJ3dznFYF7LG6rMBa0JH6omR7z7f3fClzCTu5ZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9bL4MI6fEsq21pWWKCdI1bx2_TLVKqYB4cexccp5aVHw&oe=6A32AB4C"}, {"file_name": "Cover Portrait_FULL_ES.png", "id": "1822870681733204", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827703_1822870685066537_4560401566713579284_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3CgEu3Bw1TUQ7kNvwHnMgel&_nc_oc=AdpECBKYE5b-c71gFjMbH2fh-JNg4wT2rwWS5ZQgj0-xlZppX1v5kNqJ7IvS7by1kMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9dSNxjLPM0RLF5jSKPv6syB6LA5IwrNjng-z2xgNpJyw&oe=6A32B2AC"}, {"file_name": "ECHO-DEMO-SQUARE-3.png", "id": "1465068948371145", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_1465068951704478_8306382549700619272_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xvVKwfuKXE4Q7kNvwGgLFD8&_nc_oc=AdoXl2I_mD1dTOptUHpS2ZSaBMJHPjexqwTfqKE35LmSPuFFQd1KGV4QKJ5TP2vf-9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af94DrEexdjPXQbAGOqucv95ZDiOImDGjl0vdxnZkGn9EA&oe=6A32A3C6"}]}, "id": "1234561742089673", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ecocardiograf\u00eda VR - VML", "keywords": ["Medicina", "Ultrasonido", "POCUS", "Ecografia", "Salud"], "long_description": "**Ecocardiograf\u00eda VR**, de VML, es una simulaci\u00f3n de realidad virtual que transforma c\u00f3mo estudiantes de medicina y profesionales de la salud aprenden ultrasonido card\u00edaco.\n\nEntra a una sala de simulaci\u00f3n donde dominar\u00e1s el posicionamiento del transductor, su orientaci\u00f3n y el reconocimiento anat\u00f3mico mediante pr\u00e1ctica activa. Coloca la sonda en tu paciente virtual, aj\u00fastala para encontrar las ventanas correctas, y activa el **modo rayos X** para ver c\u00f3mo tu transductor intersecta el coraz\u00f3n en tiempo real.\n\nLa m\u00e1quina ofrece tres modos de aprendizaje:\n- **Modo 2D**: videos reales de ecocardiograf\u00eda mientras escaneas\n- **Modo Congelado**: ilustraciones anat\u00f3micas donde identificas cada estructura\n- **Modo 3D**: corta un coraz\u00f3n interactivo con una sonda especial y cambia a materiales estilo ultrasonido\n\n**Egbot**, tu gu\u00eda androide, te acompa\u00f1a con un tutorial completo para aprovechar cada modo.\n\nYa seas estudiante o profesional de la salud, esta simulaci\u00f3n te da un ambiente seguro para ganar confianza antes de escanear pacientes reales.", "short_description": "Mejora tus habilidades de ecocardiograf\u00eda con esta simulaci\u00f3n inmersiva en VR. Ad\u00e9ntrate al quir\u00f3fano para escanear a tu paciente virtual con videos reales de ultrasonido, y aprende a identificar las estructuras card\u00edacas mediante visualizaciones interactivas: ve a trav\u00e9s del t\u00f3rax como si usaras rayos X, disecciona un coraz\u00f3n 3D, y m\u00e1s. Todo esto guiado por Egbot, tu tutor virtual."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vml.solutions/privacy-echocardiography-vr-vml", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Medical Learning", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vml.solutions/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_MX", "en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppor